      },
      {
        "native_id": "h0y4yz87q51z",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Audit log events and Actions workflow status updates continue to be delayed. Pull request updates and webhook deliveries are recovering as we restore event processing and work through backlogs. We’re monitoring the recovery and will share further updates as we learn more.",
        "created_at": "2026-10-21T16:17:23.261Z"
      },
      {
        "native_id": "fm8nlq0rm4tj",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Audit log events are delayed by up to 100 minutes, and Actions workflow status updates continue to experience extended delays. Pull request updates and webhook deliveries are recovering as we restore event processing and work through backlogs. We’re monitoring recovery and will share further updates as we learn more.",
