      },
      {
        "native_id": "7ljhz3k8gr19",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Audit log events continue to be delayed by up to 110 minutes. Pull request updates have recovered. Actions is recovering, and users should no longer experience impact in Actions. Webhook deliveries continue to recover as we work through backlogs. We are monitoring recovery and will share further updates as we learn more.",
