      },
      {
        "native_id": "97jwc479m99m",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Actions and webhook deliveries have recovered. Audit log events are still delayed by about 100 minutes. We are working through the backlog, and full recovery will take some time. We will share more updates as recovery continues.",
        "created_at": "2026-10-21T16:59:45.159Z"
      },
      {
        "native_id": "381h1h7093lf",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Pull request updates, Actions, and webhook deliveries have recovered. Audit log events are recovering and delays are decreasing, but we expect the remaining backlog to take approximately two to three hours to clear. We’re monitoring recovery and will share further updates.",
