      },
      {
        "native_id": "yhstpfttpfdn",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Audit log events are recovering, with delays now below 90 minutes as the remaining backlog is processed. We’ve reduced load on the event-streaming platform and are monitoring recovery. Further updates will follow.",
